      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155; margin: 0; font-style: italic;">
        "Build quality is 10/10. Real aerospace grade springs that don't weaken over time like cheap foam grippers. Worth every penny."
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
        <div style="width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; background: #111827; color: #ffffff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.3rem;">DR</div>
